{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04079","headline":"奉和圣制登太行山中言志应制 · 苏頲","name":"奉和圣制登太行山中言志应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"北山东入海，驰道上连天。\n顺动三光柱，登临万象悬。\n俛观河内邑，平指洛阳川。\n按跸夷关险，张旗亘井泉。\n晓岩中警柝，春事下蒐田。\n德重周王问，歌轻汉后传。\n宸游铺令典，睿思起芳年。\n愿以封书奏，廻銮禅肃然。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏頲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04079.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04079","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}